@local/dsh-whale-dialog README · Whale Dialog：A blue visual-novel dialogue view for the **DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web GUI**. It replaces the ordinary chat transcript with a single dialogue frame, a whale-girl portrait that reacts to the conversation, and an in-frame composer — while keeping the conversation's memory intact.

Made by [0nlyLetter](https://github.com/0nlyLetter).

<img src="assets/expr-idle.jpg" width="240" alt="Whale-girl idle portrait" />

@local/dsh-whale-dialog README · Requirements：- A DSH installation with the Web GUI and client plugin bundles (`conversation.view` / `settings.section` slots).
- Node.js 18+ for building and testing. The plugin itself has no runtime dependencies.
- A modern Chromium-based browser for the Web GUI.
